  "limits": "Traces are random routes on a grid, not a real netlist, and they may cross. Chips, LEDs and silkscreen are simplified shapes without text. The glowing-trace preset is stylized. The relief is shallow and carried mainly by the normal map. Occlusion is a blurred-height estimate, not ray traced.",
